    },
    "description": "Use only when the user explicitly asks to roll back a bad deploy ('roll it back', 'roll back checkout'). Starts a deployment that returns the service to the version before the deploy linked to the incident. Requires confirm=true: first ask the user to confirm, then call again with confirm=true. Refuses if the latest deploy isn't the one linked to the alarm.",
